Severity: Medium Risk
Context: Drippie.sol#L266
Description: The inline comments correctly note that reentrancy is possible and permitted when
state.config.interval is 0. We are currently unaware of use cases where this is desirable.
Reentrancy is one risk, flashbot bundles are a similar risk where the drip may be called multiple times by the same
actor in a single block. A malicious actor may abuse this ability, especially if interval is misconfigured as 0 due to
