  6) Then user requests admin to enable manual mode and withdraws remaining 1200
     collateral manually without fee.


Impact
When user performs deleverage with partial collateral withdraw, remaining collateral
can't be withdrawn. The only option left is emergency path via admin to enable manual
mode and then withdraw. Additionally user can try to avoid paying fee via this route,
though it's risky.


